  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 (2026-02-15): Major RDBMS improvements - Enhanced query execution, optimized join operations, improved subquery handling, better index utilization, and performance tuning across the core engine. Includes refined transaction handling, improved WAL group commits, and optimized single-file and columnar storage paths.\n      New features: Advanced query optimizer, improved index strategies, columnar storage enhancements.\n      Fixes: Edge cases in join execution, transaction isolation improvements, memory efficiency gains.\n      Breaking changes: None - full backward compatibility maintained.",
